WEBVTT

00:00:02.210 --> 00:00:04.450
So let's see...

00:00:04.450 --> 00:00:07.190
We place the Phone Décor in the Décor Decor.

00:00:10.440 --> 00:00:11.790
It's my brother-kuru!

00:00:12.640 --> 00:00:16.780
I'm pleased to see you've mastered the use of the Phone Décor-de gozaru.{TLC: sug. something like "figured out how to use" -> "mastered the use of". (to Ed: it's a little more accurate, but that's not the real point)}

00:00:16.780 --> 00:00:18.600
Pop!

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:21.910
Hey, this really works!

00:00:21.910 --> 00:00:23.540
Now we can talk to him whenever we'd like!

00:00:23.540 --> 00:00:24.420
Yeah!

00:00:24.420 --> 00:00:25.740
Hey hey, what're you guys doing?{TLC: sug. another "Hey"}

00:00:27.300 --> 00:00:29.490
U-Umm, we were merely-{#}

00:00:29.490 --> 00:00:30.510
Look!

00:00:31.030 --> 00:00:32.040
A UFO!

00:00:32.040 --> 00:00:33.240
A UFO?!

00:00:33.240 --> 00:00:34.280
Where?!

00:00:34.280 --> 00:00:37.150
Oh, wait, no... it was just a crow!

00:00:43.920 --> 00:00:45.490
Smile! Smile! Smile! Smile!

00:00:45.490 --> 00:00:47.330
Smile Precure!

00:00:47.630 --> 00:00:48.230
Let's go!

00:00:48.230 --> 00:00:49.760
Smile! Smile! Precure!

00:00:49.760 --> 00:00:50.900
All together!

00:00:51.130 --> 00:00:52.500
Smile! Smile! Precure!

00:00:52.500 --> 00:00:54.700
Jump to tomorrow!

00:00:54.870 --> 00:00:57.370
Smile Precure!

00:00:59.240 --> 00:01:02.210
Smile! Smile! Smile Precure!

00:01:02.480 --> 00:01:07.650
A smile, shining like the sun.

00:01:08.020 --> 00:01:12.850
We all carry an undying sparkle.

00:01:13.590 --> 00:01:18.790
Keep going with all you've got, girls!

00:01:19.160 --> 00:01:23.730
Those beads of sweat are diamonds.

00:01:23.130 --> 00:01:23.700
So bright!

00:01:23.730 --> 00:01:28.900
The future that you'll shine the way to

00:01:29.270 --> 00:01:35.340
When you five lights seize the will to win.

00:01:33.310 --> 00:01:35.840
Happy! Sunny! Peace! March! Beauty!

00:01:36.380 --> 00:01:37.010
Let's go!

00:01:37.010 --> 00:01:39.710
(Smile! Smile!) The power of a smile

00:01:39.710 --> 00:01:42.650
(Smile! Smile!) Joins us all together.

00:01:42.980 --> 00:01:47.460
We'll never let a friend cry!

00:01:46.820 --> 00:01:48.020
Girls! Let's go!

00:01:48.090 --> 00:01:49.690
Smile! Smile! Precure!

00:01:49.690 --> 00:01:50.830
Everybody!

00:01:50.860 --> 00:01:52.490
Smile! Smile! Precure!

00:01:52.490 --> 00:01:55.030
Fly to the future!

00:01:55.360 --> 00:01:58.530
Sparkle! Smile Precure!

00:01:59.300 --> 00:02:00.700
Smile! Smile! Smile! Smile!

00:02:00.700 --> 00:02:03.000
Smile Precure!

00:02:12.530 --> 00:02:15.680
Finding a place to talk without being seen is harder than I thought.

00:02:15.680 --> 00:02:18.440
School isn't the place for talking about Precure, is it? {TLC: "in public" -> "at school". I'm not sure about "after all" as an ending to "We can hardly". "can we?" is more natural. As another suggestion to the Ed: "School isn't the place for talking about Precure, is it?" Also, BTW, I think I know, but someone please confirm in IRC if we're using "Precure" as a plural}

00:02:18.440 --> 00:02:20.640
Well then, why not come around to my place?

00:02:20.640 --> 00:02:23.510
Correct me if I'm wrong, but doesn't your family run a shop, Akane?

00:02:23.810 --> 00:02:28.150
We're going to have our family checking up on us, no matter whose house we go to.{TLC: stealing work from Ed: "we went to" -> "we go to" for tense agreement}

00:02:28.150 --> 00:02:30.190
Oh, I've got an idea!

00:02:30.190 --> 00:02:33.390
Wouldn't it be nice to have our own little secret spot to meet up in?{TLC: to avoid making the dialogue repetitive, sug. keeping this as "Wouldn't it be nice to have our own little...?"}

00:02:33.390 --> 00:02:36.380
You mean like, a secret Precure base?

00:02:36.380 --> 00:02:37.130
Yeah!

00:02:37.130 --> 00:02:40.530
Let's go look for a secret place of our own!

00:02:48.970 --> 00:02:51.340
I think I'll take Alice...

00:02:53.540 --> 00:02:56.950
Next, let's see... Heidi and Cinderella!

00:02:57.470 --> 00:02:59.230
Oh right, and Anne!

00:03:02.720 --> 00:03:04.980
Miyuki, you're getting in my way-kuru!

00:03:04.980 --> 00:03:07.930
Sorry! We're all bringing some personal stuff to put in our base!

00:03:08.400 --> 00:03:10.860
For me, that's my favorite fairytales!

00:03:10.860 --> 00:03:12.730
Well, let's not keep them waiting-kuru!

00:03:12.730 --> 00:03:15.270
Right. One, two...

00:03:26.020 --> 00:03:27.690
A'ight, let's get movin'!

00:03:27.690 --> 00:03:30.750
A one, a two, and a one, two, three!

00:03:37.510 --> 00:03:39.450
I do hope I remembered it correctly...

00:03:40.690 --> 00:03:41.990
Here we go!

00:03:53.100 --> 00:03:55.540
Now everyone's here-kuru!

00:03:55.540 --> 00:03:57.310
Hey! Glad you all made it okay!

00:03:57.540 --> 00:03:59.720
Good thing no one got lost!

00:03:59.720 --> 00:04:02.280
We've never come from our own houses before, after all.

00:04:03.020 --> 00:04:07.420
I do still find it perplexing how we can reach this place through any bookshelf.

00:04:09.540 --> 00:04:15.490
Using the book-gates here in the Wonder Library, you can go anywhere in the world you want-kuru!

00:04:21.200 --> 00:04:24.070
Why not have our secret base here, then? It'd make travellin' a breeze!

00:04:24.070 --> 00:04:25.050
Nice thinking!

00:04:25.050 --> 00:04:26.410
That's a good idea!

00:04:26.410 --> 00:04:28.350
Where're you going, Yayoi-kuru?

00:04:28.350 --> 00:04:29.540
I'm gonna take a look around!

00:04:31.280 --> 00:04:33.090
Ow...

00:04:32.700 --> 00:04:34.410
Are you alright, Yayo-

00:04:34.900 --> 00:04:36.380
Help me!

00:04:36.380 --> 00:04:38.050
What the heck are you doin'?!

00:04:42.830 --> 00:04:44.820
And they all fall down-kuru...{RING A RING OF ROSES}

00:04:46.800 --> 00:04:49.430
No way! We're not going to have our base here!

00:04:51.110 --> 00:04:54.030
Yeah... if we can go anywhere we want...

00:04:54.030 --> 00:04:55.900
then how about we find somewhere a bit nicer?

00:04:56.230 --> 00:04:57.370
Nicer?

00:04:57.660 --> 00:05:03.310
I have just the place in my mind. Somewhere with the gravitas befitting us as Precure.

00:05:03.310 --> 00:05:04.540
Where's that?!

00:05:04.540 --> 00:05:07.720
Why don't you see for yourself?

00:05:18.210 --> 00:05:19.520
Where are we-kuru...?

00:05:19.890 --> 00:05:21.720
If you'd all follow me.

00:05:25.580 --> 00:05:28.440
Where on earth are we, Reika-chan?!

00:05:28.440 --> 00:05:29.670
Mount Fuji!

00:05:33.840 --> 00:05:36.140
Why Mount Fuji...?

00:05:39.080 --> 00:05:40.110
"The road ahead...?"

00:05:40.550 --> 00:05:44.850
Indeed. As Precure, the road we must walk will not always be easy.

00:05:45.430 --> 00:05:49.940
Life is a long journey bearing heavy burdens.{Yet no life exists without such burdens for us to carry.}{TLC: "Life is [like] a long journey bearing heavy burdens."}{#}{If this is marked I'm leaving the notes here}

00:05:49.940 --> 00:05:54.320
But at the end of the road stands Mount Fuji, the pride of Japan!

00:05:54.770 --> 00:05:59.300
I can think of no place more suited to the noble cause we stand for!

00:06:00.380 --> 00:06:03.300
I... really ain't gettin' what you're trying to go for here.

00:06:03.300 --> 00:06:07.640
It's a nice place, really, it's just a bit... cold?

00:06:08.210 --> 00:06:10.370
We're gonna catch a cold up here!

00:06:11.070 --> 00:06:14.850
Y-You're quite right... my apologies.

00:06:15.550 --> 00:06:18.210
Honestly, Reika-chan, what were you thinking?

00:06:18.210 --> 00:06:20.780
You really don't understand the spirit of a secret base!

00:06:21.740 --> 00:06:24.090
You're really fired up, aren't ya, Yayoi?

00:06:24.090 --> 00:06:28.260
Well, of course! That was nothing like what a <i>real</i> secret base is supposed to be like!

00:06:28.260 --> 00:06:29.730
Is that so?

00:06:30.280 --> 00:06:32.260
Then what on Earth makes a real secret base?

00:06:33.230 --> 00:06:36.450
Well, I'm about to show you a real secret base!

00:06:40.600 --> 00:06:43.210
Ta-da! <i>This</i> is a secret base!

00:06:43.210 --> 00:06:46.310
Whoa! This is the real thing!

00:06:46.310 --> 00:06:47.910
We could save the whole world from here!

00:06:48.140 --> 00:06:48.910
See?

00:06:50.160 --> 00:06:53.650
I see... so this is what a secret base should be.

00:06:54.980 --> 00:06:57.290
This place is seriously rockin'!

00:06:57.290 --> 00:06:58.630
Hey, you kids!

00:06:59.360 --> 00:07:01.830
You can't just walk onto the set like that!

00:07:03.330 --> 00:07:05.620
This is just a movie set!

00:07:06.350 --> 00:07:07.800
We're so sorry!

00:07:11.190 --> 00:07:15.440
I just... I wanted to see what it felt like...

00:07:15.710 --> 00:07:17.670
Acting cute won't let you get away with it!

00:07:17.670 --> 00:07:21.040
You two really don't know what you're doing, do you?

00:07:22.010 --> 00:07:23.780
Fine. Let me show you how this is done.

00:07:26.960 --> 00:07:28.890
This place is so cute!

00:07:28.890 --> 00:07:31.090
Isn't it? Come on, take a seat.

00:07:32.530 --> 00:07:35.460
You've always had quite the penchant for cute things, haven't you?

00:07:36.230 --> 00:07:37.350
Huh, I never knew!

00:07:37.350 --> 00:07:39.890
Guess we're peas in a pod then! I just love stuff like this!

00:07:40.930 --> 00:07:42.620
This place is the best!

00:07:42.620 --> 00:07:47.870
You know what'd make me <i>ultra happy</i>? Sittin' here with all these cute plushies, eatin' some okonomiyaki...

00:07:47.870 --> 00:07:50.370
Well then, shall we have some tea?

00:07:50.370 --> 00:07:52.570
Excuse me, madams...

00:07:52.570 --> 00:07:57.150
Can I politely ask you to refrain from eating and drinking in our shop?

00:07:57.150 --> 00:08:00.820
Wait... is this a plushie store?

00:08:00.820 --> 00:08:04.250
You're so cute! Mama, I want this one!

00:08:04.250 --> 00:08:06.660
Wait, no! She's not for sale!

00:08:08.230 --> 00:08:09.730
Sorry to intrude!{TLC: =_= "Stuffed Shop."}

00:08:10.990 --> 00:08:12.900
I really liked that place, too...

00:08:12.900 --> 00:08:15.300
I thought someone was gonna buy me-kuru!

00:08:15.300 --> 00:08:19.280
A'ight, now it's my turn to shine!

00:08:19.280 --> 00:08:21.610
Hey, wait for me!

00:08:22.920 --> 00:08:25.510
Huh? Is this another plushie store...?

00:08:25.940 --> 00:08:28.480
Mi... Miyuki-chan, that's not...

00:08:32.180 --> 00:08:34.650
See? Nice place, ain't it?!

00:08:34.650 --> 00:08:36.800
It's real?!

00:08:37.100 --> 00:08:37.690
Hey!

00:08:37.940 --> 00:08:40.040
Quickly, open a book-gate out of here-kuru!

00:08:40.040 --> 00:08:41.970
I can't without any books!

00:08:41.970 --> 00:08:44.560
We can hardly move books on a painting of a bookshelf...

00:08:44.560 --> 00:08:46.530
Reika-chan, now's not the time for calm contemplation!{#} {Did she say chan? It's hard to understand her voice right here}{It is chan.}

00:08:47.170 --> 00:08:50.000
Guess it's a no-go, huh?

00:08:50.210 --> 00:08:52.360
How did you girls get in here?!

00:08:52.360 --> 00:08:53.970
We're so sorry!

00:09:03.080 --> 00:09:04.980
Were you trying to kill us?!

00:09:04.980 --> 00:09:09.790
I-I just thought nobody would disturb us in there, that's all...

00:09:10.140 --> 00:09:13.760
I think we ended up disturbing the gorillas instead.

00:09:20.930 --> 00:09:22.470
Well, this is a bust.

00:09:22.960 --> 00:09:26.560
Finding a secret base is harder than I thought it'd be...

00:09:26.560 --> 00:09:29.440
I guess they don't just grow on trees.

00:09:30.390 --> 00:09:32.910
Come on, cheer up! I know we'll find one eventually!

00:09:33.330 --> 00:09:35.290
Yeah, it's just...

00:09:40.640 --> 00:09:41.690
We will!

00:09:42.260 --> 00:09:46.420
You do seem awfully enamored with the idea, Miyuki-san.

00:09:46.420 --> 00:09:48.350
Is there a reason for that?

00:09:51.280 --> 00:09:53.540
Well, see...

00:09:54.230 --> 00:09:55.200
What book is that?

00:09:55.200 --> 00:09:56.670
It's Anne of Green Gables-kuru!

00:09:57.070 --> 00:09:58.030
Yeah.

00:09:59.640 --> 00:10:03.140
I've always loved this book since I was a kid.

00:10:04.570 --> 00:10:10.880
Anne and her friend Diana had a secret little spot in the woods, where they promised to be friends forever.

00:10:12.720 --> 00:10:15.780
I've always wanted to have my own little place like that...

00:10:15.780 --> 00:10:19.630
So one day, I went into the woods and found my own little spot.

00:10:19.630 --> 00:10:24.330
I wished I could share it with a special friend, just like Anne did...{I hoped that one day I'd have a best friend I could take there, and I'd be just like Anne...}{TLC: "I wished I could share it with a special friend, just like Anne did." (also removes the overworking of "one day") "just like Anne did" -> "just like in the story" is less literal but flows better}{Yeah this is another I'm keeping the original hidden in case of second opinion}

00:10:26.440 --> 00:10:29.400
It was a really lovely place, too!

00:10:30.250 --> 00:10:32.370
Then I think we've already found our spot, haven't we?

00:10:32.550 --> 00:10:33.210
Huh?

00:10:33.210 --> 00:10:34.820
Let's go check it out, then!

00:10:34.820 --> 00:10:35.390
Yeah!

00:10:35.760 --> 00:10:39.040
I can't think of anywhere better for our secret base!

00:10:39.560 --> 00:10:41.140
You really think so?

00:10:42.320 --> 00:10:45.250
It's near the town you grew up in, right?{TLC: not as accurate, but maybe "you used to live" feels better than "lived as a kid", or perhaps even "the town you grew up in" - not that she's totally grown up, but teenagers do talk like that}

00:10:47.550 --> 00:10:48.720
Yeah.

00:10:49.690 --> 00:10:51.890
Let's play grown ups today!

00:10:51.890 --> 00:10:54.220
Okay! Then we can play tailor!

00:10:54.600 --> 00:10:58.000
Laugh while you can, little girls...

00:10:59.550 --> 00:11:02.590
Let me make this clear: I am not smiling.

00:11:02.600 --> 00:11:04.770
I am grinning menacingly!

00:11:05.440 --> 00:11:08.970
And this menace will make these humans shake in their boots!

00:11:16.450 --> 00:11:17.750
Beauty!

00:11:23.390 --> 00:11:24.790
Candy!

00:11:27.190 --> 00:11:29.950
Come on, hurry up!

00:11:33.090 --> 00:11:34.350
She's really impatient all of a sudden.{TLC: sug.}{#}

00:11:34.350 --> 00:11:36.390
Honestly, she's such a child. {Could be common to say, or could even be a Pokemon Best Wishes reference to Iris. lol}

00:11:37.920 --> 00:11:39.300
What are you laughing at?

00:11:39.300 --> 00:11:41.270
That's funny, coming from you.

00:11:41.270 --> 00:11:43.640
I'm not childish!

00:11:49.230 --> 00:11:53.980
This place is just perfect for best friends like Anne and Diana...{bosom buddies is the term used in the original book, for reference}

00:11:53.980 --> 00:11:56.710
Miyuki, how much farther is it?{TLC: (playing Ed again) "further" -> "farther"}

00:11:56.710 --> 00:11:59.730
It's really starting to feel all secrety now, though!

00:11:59.750 --> 00:12:03.020
My, this tea is most delicious, my lady!

00:12:03.040 --> 00:12:05.160
Please, help yourself to some cake.

00:12:05.160 --> 00:12:07.010
Oh, I will!

00:12:08.310 --> 00:12:11.150
Oh, that's quite delicious, my lady!

00:12:11.150 --> 00:12:13.630
I will have to try some too then!

00:12:14.300 --> 00:12:16.940
My daughter's always getting angry at me, you know.{kid background}{TLC: FWIW: "Oh, my daughter shall scold me again!"}{Editor's note: I'm not touching this on the grounds that I have no clue WTF what FWIW is supposed to mean...}

00:12:15.870 --> 00:12:17.600
What's wrong, Miyuki?{Needs Alt Style}

00:12:17.880 --> 00:12:20.590
She says I eat far too much!{kid background}

00:12:20.590 --> 00:12:23.950
Don't tell me... that's your secret spot, Miyuki?

00:12:23.950 --> 00:12:29.050
Yeah... but it looks like it's their secret spot now.{TLC: because the audio is long, sug. "theirs" -> "*their* secret spot"}

00:12:29.670 --> 00:12:30.550
Let's go.

00:12:30.550 --> 00:12:31.680
Okay.

00:12:32.180 --> 00:12:34.820
It is a shame, but we'll have to find somewhere else.

00:12:34.820 --> 00:12:35.190
Yeah.

00:12:38.880 --> 00:12:41.550
I do wish you'd stop..

00:12:42.420 --> 00:12:44.630
...with those accursed smiles!

00:12:45.090 --> 00:12:45.850
Isn't that...?!

00:12:45.850 --> 00:12:46.830
It's Wolfrun-kuru!

00:12:47.250 --> 00:12:50.670
This world shall receive the worst possible conclusion...

00:12:51.090 --> 00:12:53.520
...a Bad End!

00:12:53.520 --> 00:12:57.510
Let the pristine canvas of your future be choked in darkness!

00:13:01.650 --> 00:13:04.440
Playing grown-ups is boring...

00:13:07.420 --> 00:13:15.390
The Bad Energy we gather from the humans will resurrect the Emperor of Darkness, King Pierrot-sama!

00:13:19.970 --> 00:13:21.260
Come on, transform-kuru!{TLC: over 2.5 minutes o_O?  That beats Heartcatch.  It's a good thing magical girl transformation sequences take place in an alternate timeline.}

00:13:21.800 --> 00:13:22.700
Right!

00:13:26.400 --> 00:13:27.540
Ready?

00:13:28.320 --> 00:13:30.960
Precure, Smile Charge!

00:13:30.960 --> 00:13:31.780
Go!

00:13:32.940 --> 00:13:34.280
Go, go!

00:13:34.780 --> 00:13:36.140
Let's go!

00:15:00.400 --> 00:15:03.610
The light of the future, shining bright!

00:15:05.450 --> 00:15:07.010
Cure Happy!

00:15:09.950 --> 00:15:11.860
Dazzling sun!

00:15:11.860 --> 00:15:13.920
Hot-blooded power!

00:15:14.860 --> 00:15:16.780
Cure Sunny!

00:15:19.180 --> 00:15:22.510
Rock, paper, scissors! Sparkling bright...

00:15:23.940 --> 00:15:25.530
Cure Peace!

00:15:27.910 --> 00:15:31.240
Laying down the gauntlet, with courage blazing!

00:15:32.830 --> 00:15:34.300
Cure March!{Timer:Best part of this show!}

00:15:36.850 --> 00:15:40.160
A gentle heart as pure as the driven snow...

00:15:41.570 --> 00:15:43.170
Cure Beauty!

00:15:45.220 --> 00:15:47.920
Our five lights will blaze a path to the future!

00:15:53.890 --> 00:15:58.050
Shining bright, Smile Precure!

00:16:00.260 --> 00:16:02.670
That was quick, Precure.{TLC: XD I see what you did there, Magenta. FWIW, to Ed: lit. "So, you show yourselves, Precure!"}

00:16:02.670 --> 00:16:06.560
Today, you're going to learn just how scary I can be!{TLC: evil libfagging, but maybe something like "learn to fear me" sounds better}{Editor: No, I think the line is fine the way it is}

00:16:06.960 --> 00:16:09.490
Come forth, Akanbe!

00:16:12.380 --> 00:16:14.700
Akanbe!

00:16:15.140 --> 00:16:17.910
This is their special spot!

00:16:18.390 --> 00:16:20.840
We are not going to let you ruin it!

00:16:20.840 --> 00:16:25.260
Special spot? Bah! It's just a forest!

00:16:25.260 --> 00:16:26.790
Get them, Akanbe!

00:16:26.790 --> 00:16:28.080
Akan...

00:16:29.290 --> 00:16:29.920
be!

00:16:31.960 --> 00:16:34.000
I always forget how high I jump!

00:16:34.000 --> 00:16:35.490
Akan...

00:16:36.260 --> 00:16:36.990
be!

00:16:40.880 --> 00:16:42.330
You really don't know what's good for you, do you?

00:16:43.080 --> 00:16:47.480
Besides, how does saving this forest even begin to help you?

00:16:49.060 --> 00:16:52.430
Maybe it is just some forest to you...

00:16:52.430 --> 00:16:56.650
But to them, it's where their friendship blooms! Where they play and talk together!{TLC: to shorten a little, sug. reworking to something like "where they ... as friends!"}{Editor: Nah, line is kinda long audio wise, it's fine the way it is}

00:16:59.540 --> 00:17:03.050
It's the most amazing, special place in all the world!

00:17:05.360 --> 00:17:07.320
Oh, will you give it a rest already?

00:17:07.320 --> 00:17:09.990
Just try and stop me, if you can!

00:17:09.990 --> 00:17:12.460
Happy, you've gotta purify the Akanbe-kuru!

00:17:12.670 --> 00:17:13.580
Got it!

00:17:14.290 --> 00:17:15.930
Focus, focus, focus, focus!

00:17:17.130 --> 00:17:20.040
Focus this! Akanbe!

00:17:20.180 --> 00:17:21.640
Akan...

00:17:22.270 --> 00:17:23.010
be!

00:17:30.080 --> 00:17:31.580
Happy, now's your chance!

00:17:32.840 --> 00:17:33.880
Right!

00:17:36.690 --> 00:17:37.920
Precure...

00:17:39.150 --> 00:17:41.300
Happy...

00:17:41.750 --> 00:17:43.120
...Shower!

00:17:52.470 --> 00:17:54.830
Akanbe!

00:18:00.110 --> 00:18:02.010
You did it-kuru!

00:18:02.260 --> 00:18:05.660
Now we've got the Ring Décor too-kuru!

00:18:06.380 --> 00:18:08.220
Precure...

00:18:08.440 --> 00:18:10.200
I'll get you next time!

00:18:14.350 --> 00:18:15.930
Now it's time to play tailor!

00:18:15.930 --> 00:18:17.090
Okay!

00:18:21.100 --> 00:18:22.260
Hey!

00:18:22.260 --> 00:18:23.530
I've got an idea!

00:18:24.350 --> 00:18:26.850
Why don't we just ask the book-gates?

00:18:26.850 --> 00:18:30.390
We just have to wish for them to take us to a good secret base!

00:18:30.390 --> 00:18:33.510
You mean, let it decide where the best place would be...?

00:18:33.680 --> 00:18:34.780
Yeah!

00:18:34.780 --> 00:18:39.000
I'm sure it'll pick somewhere just right for us all!

00:18:39.000 --> 00:18:41.220
Hey, that ain't a half bad plan.

00:18:45.050 --> 00:18:46.190
Alright, let's do it.

00:18:46.960 --> 00:18:50.060
We're countin' on you, book-gates!

00:18:50.520 --> 00:18:52.370
Saying it out aloud is not necessary.{TLC: "There's no need to say it out aloud." "Saying it out aloud is not necessary."}

00:18:52.370 --> 00:18:53.160
Huh?

00:18:53.160 --> 00:18:55.890
Wishes are things to keep in your heart. {Wishes don't come true if you tell them to other people.}{TLC: "Wishes aren't meant to be said out aloud." Lib.: "Wishes are things to keep in your heart."}

00:18:55.890 --> 00:18:56.780
Huh. Really...?{TLC: if the above changes are made, maybe "really?" or something is a more appropriate response than "Never knew"}

00:18:56.780 --> 00:18:58.540
Geez, Akane...

00:19:29.300 --> 00:19:32.450
We're back in the Wonder Library-kuru...

00:19:32.450 --> 00:19:34.540
Are the book-gates broken or something?

00:19:34.540 --> 00:19:39.140
I was concentratin' really hard! "Take us to a super fun place just for us..."{TLC: "an amazing..." -> "a super fun, secret place 'of our very own'/'that we can have to ourselves'/'just for us'/'just to ourselves'!"}

00:19:39.140 --> 00:19:40.220
What?{TLC: maybe not necessary}

00:19:41.110 --> 00:19:42.040
I was too!{TLC: sug. "So was I!"}

00:19:42.040 --> 00:19:42.900
Me too!

00:19:42.900 --> 00:19:46.730
It seems we all had the same idea, then.

00:19:48.420 --> 00:19:49.820
Oh...

00:19:50.950 --> 00:19:52.520
Then this has gotta be it!

00:19:52.520 --> 00:19:56.230
Our secret spot was here the whole time!

00:19:57.530 --> 00:19:59.130
You mean like...

00:19:59.130 --> 00:19:59.700
<i>here</i> here?{twice?}{TLC: sic. Emphasise the first one or make it "Here? As in *here?*"}

00:20:01.170 --> 00:20:04.670
We really shouldn't have been so worried about what the place was like...

00:20:05.210 --> 00:20:12.240
As long as we're all together having fun, then it's all we could ever need!

00:20:12.790 --> 00:20:16.950
I bet that's what the Wonder Library was trying to tell us...

00:20:21.410 --> 00:20:25.390
Guess you've got a point. This place really does calm ya down.

00:20:25.390 --> 00:20:26.060
Yeah!

00:20:26.060 --> 00:20:30.290
Besides, I can't think of anywhere more secret than this!

00:20:31.390 --> 00:20:32.900
Well said.

00:20:32.900 --> 00:20:33.970
Yeah!

00:20:36.990 --> 00:20:38.190
Maybe we should move...

00:20:38.820 --> 00:20:40.710
a bit closer though...?

00:20:40.710 --> 00:20:43.670
Huh? What'd you say!?

00:20:46.240 --> 00:20:49.570
Miyuki, use the Star Décor to decorate the library-kuru!

00:20:49.570 --> 00:20:51.510
Huh? Okay...{TLC: another split?}

00:20:52.300 --> 00:20:54.220
Let's go: Star!

00:21:16.630 --> 00:21:18.470
We really have this all to ourselves?

00:21:18.470 --> 00:21:24.630
Hey, Candy! Why didn't you tell us before we could've done this?! We wasted all that time...{TLC: sug. "tell us before that we"}

00:21:24.630 --> 00:21:25.300
Kuru

00:21:25.300 --> 00:21:28.870
I don't think it was a waste.

00:21:28.870 --> 00:21:32.660
I mean, visiting all those places helped us realize how amazing the Wonder Library is.

00:21:34.660 --> 00:21:36.130
I guess you're right...

00:21:36.130 --> 00:21:38.980
Who was it who first objected to this place, again...?

00:21:38.980 --> 00:21:40.600
Hey, ain't no need for that!

00:21:42.910 --> 00:21:45.100
What do you think, Yayoi-san?

00:21:45.740 --> 00:21:46.600
It's a bit...

00:21:47.570 --> 00:21:48.720
out of place.

00:21:49.500 --> 00:21:52.110
Reika, decorate it with these-kuru!

00:21:54.660 --> 00:21:57.510
I guess we've finally found our own secret spot!

00:21:57.950 --> 00:21:58.750
Guess so!

00:21:58.970 --> 00:22:03.850
Well then, a toast to our new secret base, the Wonder Library!

00:22:03.850 --> 00:22:06.590
Cheers! {Precure is now teaching kids how to drink.  And later... Candy does a Keg-stand}

00:23:44.450 --> 00:23:45.760
I'm Candy...

00:23:45.760 --> 00:23:47.400
....and Candy is Miyuki ~kuru?

00:23:47.410 --> 00:23:49.010
We switched bodies!

00:23:49.210 --> 00:23:50.650
How did that happen?

00:23:50.660 --> 00:23:51.600
I don't know ~kuru.

00:23:51.610 --> 00:23:53.720
And we can't go back to normal!

00:23:53.730 --> 00:23:54.980
What will you do about school?

00:23:54.990 --> 00:23:59.100
It'll be all right, Candy will study in place of Miyuki ~kuru!

00:23:59.110 --> 00:24:00.300
That's a little...

00:24:00.320 --> 00:24:02.350
There´s no way that will turn out all right!!

00:24:03.310 --> 00:24:04.450
Smile Precure!

00:24:07.400 --> 00:24:09.500
Find your ultra happy smile!
